        }
      ],
      "message": "rpc: use GetNetwork() for addrman entry network labels\n\ngetnodeaddresses and getrawaddrman labelled entries with GetNetClass(),\nwhich reports linked-IPv4 addresses (6to4, Teredo, NAT64) as ipv4, while\nthe getnodeaddresses network filter and the getaddrmaninfo counts use\nGetNetwork() and treat them as ipv6. Use GetNetwork() so filtered results\nmatch their labels.",
